/-- [counterexample; formal-checked] **The twisted cubic on variable sets**: the generators
`y − x²` and `z − x³` (variables `{x, y}`, `{x, z}`) fail the curve's check at `(y, z)`, and with
`y³ − z²` (variables `{y, z}`) added they pass. -/
theorem twisted_cubic_supports :
    ¬ CoversSets ({{0, 1}, {0, 2}} : Finset (Finset (Fin 3))) 1 ∧
      CoversSets ({{0, 1}, {0, 2}, {1, 2}} : Finset (Finset (Fin 3))) 1 := by
  decide

